OL,4,CFly-tipping fears over booking system  
OL,5,Cat tips                                
OL,6,GCouncillors in Worcestershire have     
OL,7,Gsaid they are worried fly-tipping      
OL,8,Gcould increase once a booking system   
OL,9,Gis launched at household recycling     
OL,10,Gcentres in the county.                 
OL,12,FThe change is expected to come into    
OL,13,Fforce in February or March next year,  
OL,14,Fat all 11 tips, in a bid to save       
OL,15,F#500,000 a year.                       
OL,17,FConservative councillor Dan Birch      
OL,18,Fsaid: "More than 2,500 people signed a 
OL,19,Fpetition against this, but they        
OL,20,Fhaven't been listened to."             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
