OL,4,CThe farmland at the heart of an 8,000- 
OL,5,Chome row                               
OL,6,GA council has defended plans to build  
OL,7,Galmost 8,000 homes on farmland north   
OL,8,Gof Telford, saying there is little     
OL,9,Galternative land available for large-  
OL,10,Gscale development.                     
OL,12,FTelford and Wrekin Council has         
OL,13,Fidentified three sites where it wants  
OL,14,Fto create new "sustainable             
OL,15,Fcommunities" over the next 15 years as 
OL,16,Fpart of its updated Local Plan.        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
